"id":"quartic.lemma-4","kind":"claim","label":"Lemma 4","locator":"Lemma 4, Section 4.2","source_id":"paper","statement":"**Lemma 4** (bounded amplification ([OpenAI 2026](#cite-OpenAI2026), Lemma 3.1); see @BBHT1998 and @BHMT2002). *Let $A$ prepare a state with a success flag, with success probability $p$. For $0<\\gamma\\le1/2$ and $0<\\eta<1/2$ there is a procedure making $O(\\gamma^{-1/2}\\log(1/\\eta))$ calls to $A$ and $A^{-1}$ on every branch, for every $p$, that either reports failure or produces a successful outcome. Conditional on success, the measured label has the same distribution as in the successful part of $A$'s state. If $p\\ge\\gamma$ it fails with probability at most $\\eta$, and if $p=0$ it always fails.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197a18a158ed14e47c792db1a40/nodes/quartic.lemma-4","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197a18a158ed14e47c792db1a40/nodes/quartic.lemma-4","id":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197a18a158ed14e47c792db1a40/edges/%5B%22quartic.lemma-4%22%2C%22lean.QuarticQuery.Amplification.bounded_amplification%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197a18a158ed14e47c792db1a40/edges/%5B%22quartic.lemma-4%22%2C%22lean.QuarticQuery.Amplification.bounded_amplification%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197a18a158ed14e47c792db1a40/nodes/lean.QuarticQuery.Amplification.bounded_amplification"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197a18a158ed14e47c792db1a40/nodes/quartic.lemma-4","id":"field:349c708683f65de96c54090dec945e3c16e225d03dd76b13e5442098b392e9da","kind":"evidence_ids","owner_ref":"sha256:b01fb7dc64f90c9c1f9fb29554b974330c989197a18a158ed14e47c792db1a40/nodes/quartic.lemma-4","semantic_class":"provenance_fie